    <h2>The "Maine Clone Season" — When to Buy</h2>
    <p>Maine clone vendors typically take orders February-April for spring pickup. <strong>Pickup window:</strong> late April to early June (corresponds to last-frost dates by region). Walk-in availability depends on demand; pre-order is recommended for popular strains. Late-summer (July-August) is when some vendors have a "second run" of clones for indoor growers or quick-finish outdoor.</p>
